; name: Fluted post
; group: Rotary axis
; description: Three stopped flutes on each face of a 60 mm square post, cut with a Ø6 ball nose: one profile in a rotary repeat that turns the post (along X; zero on the axis, at the −X end where the chuck is) to each face in turn. Change the number, spacing and depth of the flutes with the variables.
; 
